```mermaid
sequenceDiagram
    participant TUF as TUF Repository
    participant CDN as CDN/Proxy
    participant Init as Init Container
    participant Vol as Shared Volume
    participant App as Edge Application
    participant Mon as Monitoring

    Note over Init,App: Container Pod Startup

    %% Initialization Phase
    Init->>+TUF: Request root.json
    TUF->>CDN: root.json
    CDN->>-Init: root.json (signed)
    
    Init->>Init: Verify root signatures
    Note over Init: Establish trust anchor
    
    Init->>+TUF: Request timestamp.json
    TUF->>CDN: timestamp.json  
    CDN->>-Init: timestamp.json (signed)
    
    Init->>Init: Verify timestamp freshness
    Note over Init: Check for rollback attacks
    
    Init->>+TUF: Request snapshot.json
    TUF->>CDN: snapshot.json
    CDN->>-Init: snapshot.json (signed)
    
    Init->>Init: Verify snapshot consistency
    Note over Init: Ensure metadata coherence
    
    Init->>+TUF: Request targets.json
    TUF->>CDN: targets.json
    CDN->>-Init: targets.json (signed)
    
    Init->>Init: Verify targets metadata
    Note over Init: Validate file inventory
    
    %% File Download Phase
    loop For each target file
        Init->>+TUF: Request target file
        TUF->>CDN: target file
        CDN->>-Init: target file (binary)
        
        Init->>Init: Verify file hash
        Note over Init: SHA-256 verification
        
        alt File verification successful
            Init->>Vol: Extract/Copy file
            Init->>Mon: Log success
        else Verification failed
            Init->>Mon: Log failure & alert
            Init->>Init: Reject file
        end
    end
    
    %% Completion Phase
    Init->>Vol: Set file permissions
    Init->>Vol: Signal completion
    Note over Init: Init container exits
    
    %% Application Startup
    App->>Vol: Check for required files
    Vol->>App: Files available
    
    App->>App: Start application logic
    App->>Mon: Application ready
    
    %% Runtime Monitoring
    loop Periodic health checks
        Mon->>App: Health check
        App->>Mon: Status response
        
        opt File updates available
            Note over Init: New init container spawned
            Init->>TUF: Check for updates
            TUF->>Init: Updated metadata
            Init->>Vol: Update files
            App->>App: Reload configuration
        end
    end

    %% Error Scenarios
    alt Network failure during download
        Init->>TUF: Request file
        TUF->>X Init: Network timeout
        Init->>Init: Retry with backoff
        Init->>Mon: Log network issue
        
        opt Cache available
            Init->>Vol: Use cached files
            Note over Init: Graceful degradation
        end
    end
    
    alt Signature verification failure
        Init->>Init: Verify signatures
        Init->>X Vol: Reject malicious file
        Init->>Mon: Security alert
        Note over Init: Fail-safe behavior
    end
```